signup_code.text:
Your sign-up code: {code}

It is valid for {minutes, plural, one {# minute} other {# minutes}}. Do not share it with anyone.

If you did not sign up, just ignore this email.

password_reset_code.text:
Your password reset code: {code}

It is valid for {minutes, plural, one {# minute} other {# minutes}}. Do not share it with anyone.

If you did not request a reset, ignore this email and your password will stay the same.

email_change_code.text:
Code to change your account email to this address: {code}

It is valid for {minutes, plural, one {# minute} other {# minutes}}. Do not share it with anyone.

If you did not change your email, ignore this email.

email_changed.text:
The email of your account was changed. This message was sent to the previous address.

When: {time}

If it was not you, contact support right away.

password_changed.text:
The password of your account was changed or set, other sessions were signed out.

When: {time}

If it was not you, reset your password on the sign-in screen and contact support.

session_revoked_suspicious.text:
We ended a session of your account: its sign-in key was reused, which happens when it is stolen. Please sign in again.

When: {time}

If this happens again, change your password.

mfa_enabled.text:
Two-factor protection was enabled on your account. Keep your recovery codes in a safe place.

When: {time}

If it was not you, contact support right away.

mfa_disabled.text:
Two-factor protection was disabled on your account.

When: {time}

If it was not you, change your password and contact support.

recovery_code_used.text:
A recovery code was used to sign in to your account. Codes left: {left}.

When: {time}

If it was not you, change your password and regenerate your recovery codes.

recovery_codes_regenerated.text:
The recovery codes of your account were regenerated, the previous ones no longer work.

When: {time}

If it was not you, change your password and contact support.

account_restored.text:
The deletion of your account was cancelled, the account is available again.

When: {time}

If it was not you, change your password and contact support.

mfa_reset_done.text:
Following a support request, the two-factor protection of your account was reset and all sessions were signed out. Sign in with your password and enable it again.

When: {time}

If you did not contact support, contact it right away.

captain_application_rejected.text:
{nickname}, your captain application in {city} has been declined.

Reason: {reason}{has_comment, select, yes {
Moderator comment: {comment}} other {}}

You can apply again 7 days after the decision.

bootstrapped.body:
The server operator added a new owner to the admin panel: {name} ({email}).

When: {time}

The new owner will receive an invitation and sign in after setting up a second factor. If you did not expect this, check the activity log in the admin panel: {origin}

locked.body:
The staff account of {name} ({email}) is locked for an hour after five wrong second-factor codes in a row.

When: {time}
Network: {ip}

If this was not the staff member, contact them and reset their access in the admin panel if needed: {origin}

admin_disabled.body:
The admin account of {name} ({email}) has been disabled: sign-in and all its sessions are closed.

Disabled by: {actor}
When: {time}{has_reason, select, yes {
Reason: {reason}} other {}}

If you did not expect this, check the activity log in the admin panel: {origin}
